# Staged photographs, not assertions (GALLERY.md): a person opens each image. Pass: -DepMap wsl-deps.galerie.map.
# SHOTLIST of 2026-11-08, revised after the director pass (Opus) on the captures of tickets 66e9, fab9, a447 and the validation of enclosure-south (2026-11-08):
# the Nelim logo (flower growing zones, about x 136-152, z 205-222) stays free of objects, so props, hay and the nest sit east of x 153 or west of x 136.
# STORY. "Feeding day at the dodo pen". Nelim, keeper of the Sanctuary, spends one day with the dodo flock in the enclosure-south pen:
# she opens the gate at dawn, drops breakfast hay, tosses berries at noon, tucks the hens in at 15, herds the last bird home at 18 and
# lays the last hay in the barn at 19. One start hour per image, clear sky, the light moves through the day (7, 10, 12, 15, 18, 19). Nelim (NSB canon): hair Hair_DarkSaturatedReddish rgb (56, 36, 18),
# Roo_Royal_LongHD under TSFApparel_StrawHat, mustard Apparel_BasicShirt rgb (205, 150, 40), smile MouthLipsSimpleSmile (owner, 2026-11-07).
# Indoors (6) the game takes the hat off. Roots vary on purpose: 4 opening, 3.2 and 3 middle, 2.4 tight, 3.5 path home, 2.8 closing.
# Gestures are obtained by pose steps: pawns stand at a cell facing a direction, carry then put down an item (hands empty after, the hay or berries stay on the ground), animals stand or lie at a cell, the game is paused after 60 ticks of set-up.
#   1. workshop-1-dawn; enclosure-south, south gate in the fence row at z 207; 7h; root 4
#        Seven dodos, one per coat, scattered in depth and facing the camera north of Nelim, who stands at (159, 209) facing South at the open gate
#        with empty hands; TorchLamp lit on both gate posts at (158, 208) and (160, 208), Plant_Daylily, Plant_YellowTallGrass, DR_StickLantern lit, Stool, PlantPot_Daylily, Hay dropped at (153, 211) and (165, 212). Instant: she has just
#        pulled the gate open. Says: The pen wakes up in many colours.
#        Frame: wide, root 4 centred (159, 211); foreground the fence row with the two lit gate posts, middle the flock, top tall grass and daylilies; Nelim low centre; low warm light of 7h.
#   2. workshop-2-breakfast; enclosure-south, east of the logo (157, 213); 10h; root 3.2
#        Hay lies in a pile at (157, 213); Nelim stands at (154, 213) facing East toward it, hands empty, smiling; five dodos (coats 0, 2, 3, 5, 6)
#        close around the pile at (155, 214), (159, 214), (157, 216), (160, 212), (156, 211), facing it; DR_StickLantern lit at (154, 211) and (156, 219), TorchLamp lit at (154, 216), Stool, PlantPot_Daylily, Plant_Daylily, Plant_YellowTallGrass. Instant: before the first peck.
#        Says: Breakfast is served.
#        Frame: medium, root 3.2 centred (157, 213); foreground the hay pile, Nelim off-centre left, dodos right and behind, lit lanterns at the edges; bright 10h light.
#   3. workshop-3-seven-coats; enclosure-south, east side (155, 216); 12h; root 3
#        Berries lie at (155, 216); the seven coats (0 to 6) packed around them, facing the pile; Nelim at (151, 216) facing East;
#        PlantPot_Daylily, Plant_Daylily, Plant_YellowTallGrass, TorchLamp lit at (159, 217), DR_StickLantern lit at (154, 214). Instant: the berries have just landed.
#        Says: Seven coats, one flock.
#        Frame: medium, root 3 centred (154, 216); berries in the foreground centre, the seven coats in a tight ring behind, Nelim left, torch and lantern lit at the back; noon light.
#   4. workshop-4-the-nest; enclosure-south, nesting boxes, west of the logo (133, 214); 15h; root 2.4
#        A hen (coat 4) lies asleep on a hay nest at (133, 214), the cells cleared first (a daylily stood there), with one egg beside her at (134, 213); Nelim stands at (136, 214) facing West
#        looking down at the hen, the egg in her hand; EggBox, DR_StickLantern lit at (135, 217), TorchLamp lit at (135, 211), Stool, Plant_Daylily, Plant_YellowTallGrass. Instant: she has just set the egg down beside the hen.
#        Says: A quiet afternoon, one egg.
#        Frame: tight, root 2.4 centred (134, 214); the hen low centre on her nest, Nelim right looking down, EggBox and lanterns at the back; soft 15h light.
#   5. workshop-5-golden-hour; enclosure-south, west gate (139, 217); 18h; root 3.5
#        Shogun at (138, 216) faces West toward a straggling dodo (coat 2) at (135, 215); three more dodos (coats 1, 3, 5) walk East, away from the
#        low sun; Nelim at (136, 218) behind them; TorchLamp lit at (134, 217), DR_StickLantern lit at (135, 220), Plant_Daylily, Plant_YellowTallGrass; the pen emptied of other animals.
#        Instant: the straggler has just stopped. Says: The last bird comes home.
#        Frame: medium, root 3.5 centred (139, 217); Shogun and the straggler in the foreground, three dodos walking away into the background, Nelim small behind; low golden 18h light, lanterns lit.
#   6. workshop-6-roost; barn, east extension (201, 238); 19h; root 2.8
#        Four dodos (coats 0, 2, 4, 6) asleep on hay, one lit Brazier at (201, 236); Nelim at (200, 236) facing East, hat off indoors, poker table and dining chairs hidden, smiling at them, the last
#        armfuls of Hay laid at (201, 237), (199, 239) and (203, 239); DR_StickLantern lit at (204, 236), Stool, PlantPot_Daylily. Instant: the last bird has just settled. Says: Everyone is home.
#        Frame: tight, root 2.8 centred (201, 238); four sleeping dodos on hay in the foreground, Nelim at the left edge, lit Brazier, DR_StickLantern and Stool behind; warm firelight at 19h.
# Interface windows: none (the mod has no settings, no menu).
